Subject: [PATCH] css: system font keywords from the profile

The CSS system font keywords such as menu, small-caption and status-bar
resolve to the family and size in the profile's theme.system_fonts
table. On a Linux build all six keywords otherwise give Arial at the
default size, because the Windows handling is compiled only into Windows
builds. A Windows profile reports Segoe UI at 12px for menu,
small-caption and status-bar, as a real Windows machine does. A keyword
changes only when the profile gives both its family and its size.

diff --git a/base/apostate/profile.h b/base/apostate/profile.h
index 35ee265..7760755 100644
--- a/base/apostate/profile.h
+++ b/base/apostate/profile.h
@@ -243,6 +243,26 @@ class BASE_EXPORT Profile {
     return gl_precisions_;
   }
 
+  // One CSS system font: the family and size a system font keyword resolves to.
+  struct SystemFont {
+    std::string family;
+    double size_px = 0;
+  };
+
+  // CSS system fonts, keyed by the keyword as CSS spells it — "menu",
+  // "small-caption", "status-bar", "caption", "icon", "message-box".
+  //
+  // Which keywords diverge is a platform fact and a narrow one. Chromium's
+  // Windows provider routes only small-caption, menu and status-bar to the
+  // shell's non-client metrics and lets the other three fall through to the
+  // same Arial/16px default our Linux build uses, so a Windows profile differs
+  // from a Linux host on exactly three of the six. The values behind them come
+  // from SPI_GETNONCLIENTMETRICS, which is the user's Windows theme rather than
+  // anything derivable, so they are replayed from the capture.
+  const std::map<std::string, SystemFont>& css_system_fonts() const {
+    return css_system_fonts_;
+  }
+
   // IANA timezone name, e.g. "Europe/Warsaw".
   //
   // Only the zone *name* is a host fact. ICU's data is compiled into the binary
@@ -329,6 +349,7 @@ class BASE_EXPORT Profile {
   std::map<std::string, int> gl_limits_;
   std::set<std::string> gl_extensions_;
   std::map<std::string, ShaderPrecision> gl_precisions_;
+  std::map<std::string, SystemFont> css_system_fonts_;
   std::optional<std::string> timezone_;
   std::optional<bool> prefers_dark_;
   std::optional<std::string> accept_languages_;
diff --git a/base/apostate/profile.cc b/base/apostate/profile.cc
index 1be796d..cf8f1b1 100644
--- a/base/apostate/profile.cc
+++ b/base/apostate/profile.cc
@@ -267,6 +267,37 @@ Profile* Profile::ParseOrNull(const std::string& encoded) {
     }
